|   +---------+---------+  +-----------+-----------+  +-------+-------+   |
+-------------|------------------------|----------------------|-----------+
              | Form Submission        | Hydrated Page Load   | Static Assets
              v                        v                      v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                        Next.js Web Server (Edge)                        |
|                                                                         |
|            +-----------------------------------------------+            |
|            | Middleware (Auth Cookie Check & Redirection)  |            |
|            +-----------------------+-----------------------+            |
|                                    |                                    |
|       +----------------------------+----------------------------+       |
|       |                                                         |       |
|       v                                                         v       |
|  +----+------------------------+                         +------+----+  |
|  | Server Actions & API Routes |                         | Pages &   |  |
|  | (signIn, refresh, signout)  |                         | Layouts   |  |
|  +----+------------------------+                         +------+----+  |
+-------|---------------------------------------------------------|-------+
        | Read/Write DB                                           | Query
        v                                                         v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                             Supabase Cloud                              |
|                                                                         |
|   +--------------------+  +-------------------+  +------------------+   |
|   |   Supabase Auth    |  |  PostgreSQL DB    |  | RLS System       |   |
|   | (Google / Email)   |  | (Profiles, Logs)  |  | (Data Firewall)  |   |
|   +--------------------+  +-------------------+  +------------------+   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
</div>

<h2>Communication & Lifecycle Flows</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Frontend to Backend Communication:</strong> Client-side events (like form submissions) execute Next.js Server Actions. These actions validate inputs via Zod, perform database transactions with the Supabase client, and set cookie headers.</li>
  <li><strong>Request/Response Lifecycle:</strong>
    <ol>
      <li>Browser requests a page (e.g. <code>/profile</code>).</li>
      <li><code>middleware.ts</code> runs, intercepting the request. It calls <code>updateSession</code> to keep the Supabase token alive, then extracts and decodes the <code>accbot_access_token</code>.</li>
      <li>If authenticated, the page is rendered on the server with user details. If expired, it checks the refresh token; if invalid, it redirects the browser to <code>/login?next=/profile</code>.</li>
      <li>The server returns HTML, which is hydrated on the client.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>

